{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103520","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103520","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710352001:0":{"text":"是……是佩吉公主？！殿下！您怎么也会在这个鬼地方？","source_cn":"是……是佩吉公主？！殿下！您怎么也会在这个鬼地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8425C59AEB48F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710352002:1":{"text":"公主殿下！感谢艾雅！救救我们！外面那些盔甲……它们活了！","source_cn":"公主殿下！感谢艾雅！救救我们！外面那些盔甲……它们活了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAACC6C30910CFABB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710352003:1":{"text":"公主殿下，鄙人乃《赛凡纳晨报》的主编伦道夫。请恕我们失礼，实在是……情况危急。","source_cn":"公主殿下，鄙人乃《赛凡纳晨报》的主编伦道夫。请恕我们失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2F4F9A80E817013","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710352004:1":{"text":"现在不是多礼的时候。你们……是怎么进来的？大门明明已经打不开了。","source_cn":"现在不是多礼的时候。你们……是怎么进来的？大门明明已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB18822550221DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710352005:1":{"text":"这……我也不知道。我正在花园里举办茶会，刚端起一杯红茶……","source_cn":"这……我也不知道。我正在花园里举办茶会，刚端起一杯红茶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A1D8FECCA76D7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710352006:1":{"text":"眨眼之间，花园没了，客人们也没了，而我孤身一人来到了这里！这也太可怕了！","source_cn":"眨眼之间，花园没了，客人们也没了，而我孤身一人来到了这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCA06487F8BF106F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710352007:1":{"text":"我也是！殿下！我当时正在府邸的书房内，审阅庆典开支报表……","source_cn":"我也是！殿下！我当时正在府邸的书房内，审阅庆典开支报表……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB354393BB9A2B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710352008:1":{"text":"我刚拿起羽毛笔，只觉得眼前一黑，还以为自己老毛病犯了！可再睁眼时，就莫名其妙地坐在这冷冰冰的地板上了！","source_cn":"我刚拿起羽毛笔，只觉得眼前一黑，还以为自己老毛病犯了！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA51CC135A761D4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710352009:1":{"text":"公主殿下，我刚才躲在这里观察了许久。","source_cn":"公主殿下，我刚才躲在这里观察了许久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF87A1C0657684A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710352010:1":{"text":"这陈列的棺椁，还有内饰的风格……如果我没看错的话……这里是<style=\"highlight\">圣古堂</style>？！","source_cn":"这陈列的棺椁，还有内饰的风格……如果我没看错的话……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788E587945949C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710352011:1":{"text":"没错，这里是圣古堂内部。","source_cn":"没错，这里是圣古堂内部。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD70337E37F85165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710352012:1":{"text":"艾雅啊，原来那个急报是真的！公主殿下，就在刚才，我的记者从广场发回了消息，说您和那位宫廷魔法师踏入圣古堂之后……","source_cn":"艾雅啊，原来那个急报是真的！公主殿下，就在刚才，我的记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ECCC8324DC02C90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710352013:1":{"text":"整个圣古堂，在众目睽睽之下，<style=\"highlight\">凭空消失</style>了！","source_cn":"整个圣古堂，在众目睽睽之下，<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C310DDDD9E5C05D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710352014:1":{"text":"消失了？","source_cn":"消失了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8394E1878D7F2817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710352015:1":{"text":"在我们踏入圣古堂之后？","source_cn":"在我们踏入圣古堂之后？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB88F59023A4C5D18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710352016:1":{"text":"是的！我正准备要把这个惊天头条排上版面，结果自己也进来了！","source_cn":"是的！我正准备要把这个惊天头条排上版面，结果自己也进来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x620C4A8E6919DA3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710352017:1":{"text":"原来并非我和公主被传送……而是整座圣古堂连同内部空间一起转移了？","source_cn":"原来并非我和公主被传送……而是整座圣古堂连同内部空间一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A11F1552BC72D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710352018:1":{"text":"殿下，如果伦道夫主编说的是真的，那这就不是简单的“封门”了。","source_cn":"殿下，如果伦道夫主编说的是真的，那这就不是简单的“封门”了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1A9827962FA3C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710352019:1":{"text":"……要把圣古堂这种体量的存在从现实空间转移，这需要的巨量的魔力，还有提前布置的超阶法阵……","source_cn":"……要把圣古堂这种体量的存在从现实空间转移，这需要的巨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x031079C255D8357E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710352020:1":{"text":"看来，这是一个精心设计的陷阱。","source_cn":"看来，这是一个精心设计的陷阱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46F146CF2BE04D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710352021:1":{"text":"陷阱？！那我们会死吗？我不想死啊！","source_cn":"陷阱？！那我们会死吗？我不想死啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44DD0C66F062F72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710352022:1":{"text":"不要吧，我什么都没做啊？！","source_cn":"不要吧，我什么都没做啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE82CA76F5FD8A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710352023:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">安静！</style>你是想把魔法盔甲引来吗？！","source_cn":"<style=highlight>安静！</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7DFA36235B32780","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1710352024:1":{"text":"贵族们被佩吉的气势震慑，瞬间安静下来，只有恐惧的呼吸声。外面的脚步声迟疑了片刻，又渐渐远去。","source_cn":"贵族们被佩吉的气势震慑，瞬间安静下来，只有恐惧的呼吸声...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88E940A7E925BE55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1710352025:1":{"text":"听着。现在慌乱解决不了任何问题，只会让我们送命。既然我们同在此处，我，佩吉·奥古斯塔，绝不会丢下你们不管。","source_cn":"听着。现在慌乱解决不了任何问题，只会让我们送命。既然我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8AEED216CB7D029","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1710352026:1":{"text":"科丝蒂也是全耀光最优秀的魔法师之一，她会负责侦查那些盔甲的动向。","source_cn":"科丝蒂也是全耀光最优秀的魔法师之一，她会负责侦查那些盔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02D73BDA77631034","variant_status":"","mal